{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19102300","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19102300","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910230001:1":{"text":"わっ、中にこんな大きな洞窟があったんだね……","source_cn":"咦？原来里面还有个这么大的洞窟呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B7803769D9958A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910230002:1":{"text":"奥が全然見えない……この先には何があるんだろ？お宝が隠されてたりして！","source_cn":"看不到尽头……里面会有什么呢？会不会有宝藏？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A620AC1A3D56F03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910230003:1":{"text":"それか、まだ誰も辿り着いたことがない秘密の場所？もしくは……","source_cn":"这个海洞的深处会不会连通着从未被人发现的秘密区域？说不定……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5F2A67A3BDBFAB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910230004:1":{"text":"はいはい、そこまで。海獣の巣だったらどうすんだ。","source_cn":"停！里头万一是鱼怪的老巢怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142531F0B8CCC763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910230005:1":{"text":"海に出るときの鉄則は、深入りしすぎないことだ。船を遠くまで出しすぎると、帰れなくなるからな。","source_cn":"出海打渔有个规矩——适可而止。船划得太远，就回不来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD640CF7DEB0C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1910230005":{"text":"海に出るときの鉄則は、深入りしすぎないことだ。船を遠くまで出しすぎると、帰れなくなるからな。","source_cn":"出海打渔有个规矩——适可而止。船划得太远，就回不来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD640CF7DEB0C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910230006:1":{"text":"おい、のっぽ！それはどういう意味だよ！","source_cn":"大个子，你啥意思！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA33887603E195E04","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"おい、のっぽ！それはどういう意味だよ！","female":"おい、のっぽ！それはどういう意味だよ！","variant_male_record_index":"293665","variant_female_record_index":"293666","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910230007:1":{"text":"おいらはいつだって真面目だ！","source_cn":"咱一向很靠谱！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBC7F339B9E824C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"おいらはいつだって真面目だ！","female":"おいらはいつだって真面目だ！","variant_male_record_index":"293667","variant_female_record_index":"293668","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910230010:1":{"text":"分かった……確かにもう遅いもんね。早く帰らないと、ばあばが心配しちゃう。","source_cn":"好吧……今天的确太晚了，再不回去阿嬷要着急了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA34EFF85E36327","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910230011:1":{"text":"でも、やっぱり中に何があるのか気になるから、また今度一緒に探検しようね！","source_cn":"不过，我还是很好奇里面有什么……我们有空再来这里探险吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EFEDA5BB59E2CFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_r